---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How Viger Cloud collects, uses and protects your personal data."
>
  <section class="section container legal-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Viger Cloud ("we", "us") operates viger.cloud and the Viger Cloud suite of business
      applications. For data protection enquiries, contact
      <a href="mailto:privacy@viger.cloud">privacy@viger.cloud</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account data</strong> — name, email address and authentication details when you sign in via Clerk.</li>
      <li><strong>Contact form data</strong> — information you submit when requesting a demo or support.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage analytics</strong> — anonymised page views if analytics is enabled (see Cookie policy).</li>
      <li><strong>Application data</strong> — business data you enter in arcarna and other apps (orders, products, customers). This is processed to provide the service.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use your data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To provide and improve the Viger Cloud services.</li>
      <li>To respond to enquiries and support requests.</li>
      <li>To send service-related communications (not marketing unless you opt in).</li>
      <li>To maintain security and prevent fraud.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Legal basis (UK GDPR)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contract</strong> — processing necessary to deliver the services you use.</li>
      <li><strong>Legitimate interests</strong> — improving our products, security and analytics.</li>
      <li><strong>Consent</strong> — where required for optional cookies or marketing.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We use subprocessors to operate the service, including Clerk (authentication), hosting
      providers and (where configured) analytics. We do not sell your personal data.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>
      Account data is retained while your account is active. Business data in arcarna is retained
      according to your subscription and applicable legal requirements (including tax record
      retention where applicable).
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under UK GDPR you have rights to access, rectify, erase, restrict, port and object to
      processing. Contact <a href="mailto:privacy@viger.cloud">privacy@viger.cloud</a>. You may
      also complain to the ICO.
    </p>

    <h2>International transfers</h2>
    <p>
      Some subprocessors may process data outside the UK. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in
      place.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
